  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1503.01 Prerequisite. Any person who receives a waiver of a restoration fee shall have his or her license restored only if all the conditions set forth in Saf-C 205.01(a), (c) and (d) have been met.\n\nSource. #5346, eff 3-10-92; ss by #6702, eff 3-3-98, EXPIRED: 3-3-06\n\nNew. #8785, eff 1-3-07, EXPIRED: 1-3-15\n\nNew. #11172, INTERIM, eff 8-29-16, EXPIRED: 2-25-17\n\nNew. #12212, eff 6-16-17\n\nAPPENDIX\n\nRul | Statute\n\nSaf-C 1501.01 | RSA 259:12-c\n\nSaf-C 1501.02 | RSA 259:13\n\nSaf-C 1501.03 | RSA 259:19\n\nSaf-C 1501.04 | RSA 259:20-a\n\nSaf-C 1501.05 | RSA 259:48\n\nSaf-C 1501.06-1501.07 | RSA 541-A:7\n\nSaf-C 1501.08 | RSA 259:90\n\nSaf-C 1501.09 | RSA 259:107\n\nSaf-C 1502.01-1503.01 | RSA 261:141, X; RSA 263:42, V",
